\meta{position}{Marie Skłodowska-Curie Fellow}

\p{
  I am a \em{Marie Skłodowska-Curie Fellow} at \em{Università di Bologna, Italy}, and \em{INRIA, OLAS, France}.
  I study mathematical foundations of computation, through an algebraic lens.
  My research spans programming languages, type theory, category theory, logic, semantics, constructive mathematics, and formalisation.
}
